  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ut43Lym.png\" alt=\"标题\"></p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&amp;label=Discord&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/MarsThePlanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=MarsThePlanet&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/laser-bridges-doors\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/776337?color=F16436&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Curseforge&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flaser-bridges-and-doors\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/laser-bridges-and-doors?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=modrinth&amp;color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> </strong></h5><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5NxocZK.gif\" alt=\"\"> <br>本模组引入了未来风格的激光桥、门和栅栏，它们由激光源方块在被红石信号激活后形成。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C17yBiD.gif\" alt=\"\"> <br>其长度取决于红石信号的强度，并会动态更新。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VsMln86.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"411\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uFErCaY.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"411\"> <br>你可以手持染料右键点击激光源方块，或使用发射器来为其染色。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VX4VIHg.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9qpoRLo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"411\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yZ8J54O.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"411\"> <br>要合成激光源方块，请在合成格中将一个玻璃方块和7个铁锭围绕着一个末地水晶放置。你可以通过将激光源方块放入合成格来合成激光栅栏源方块，且这种转换是双向的。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>配置：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>你可以在游戏中直接配置本模组，或编辑你的配置文件文件夹中的JSON文件<code>config/laserbridges.json</code>。如果你使用的是Fabric并希望在游戏内调整配置值，你需要安装<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">模组菜单</a>。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>show_next_level</strong> - 一个满功率激光源方块产生的激光的最大长度。所有其他长度均基于此值计算，默认为15。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>blocks_cut_through_by_lasers</strong> - 可以被激光穿透的方块列表。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VMhMBQw.png\" height=\"400\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JNZ2GMV.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deimos-fabric-forge-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83sD0W8.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdeimos\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j2GIPnt.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/marstheplanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rJIRiP5.png\"></a></p>",
